# Build context for Rust container images is the repo root (Cargo workspace).
.git
node_modules
**/node_modules
target
**/target
**/dist
**/.wrangler
docs
research
.agents
.claude
# The real-task arenas' lockfiles: the runner image installs their dependency snapshots.
!research/real-arena/*/deps/package.json
!research/real-arena/*/deps/package-lock.json
